# HELLSPUR: every boss and what beating it does: each sets its part of the
# story going (the Puck King leaves the crank's chest, the Tallyman frees
# Hope Springs, the Storm Crow drops its feather, the Reaper gives up his
# winged horses, and so on). Each fight is played out by the demo player
# with the foes worn down first.
